Additive CREATE INDEX CONCURRENTLY IF NOT EXISTS statements only, one per org_id table that lacks a leading-org_id index; no table, column, constraint, or data change, so every existing row already satisfies the post-migration schema and no operator data repair is possible. Each build is idempotent and retry-safe (the in-file DO block drops this file's own INVALID indexes before rebuilding), and the runner applies the no-transaction file statement by statement under its own bounded lock_timeout.
